{"id":3332,"date":"2026-06-22T08:58:10","date_gmt":"2026-06-22T08:58:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=3332"},"modified":"2026-10-02T06:51:54","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T06:51:54","slug":"tree-of-life-handcrafted-stone-mural","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/tree-of-life-handcrafted-stone-mural\/","title":{"rendered":"Tree of Life Handcrafted Stone Mural"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"1072\">Jain Stones &amp; Tiles presents the <strong data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"649\">Tree of Life Handcrafted Stone Mural Panel<\/strong>, a premium decorative wall art solution inspired by one of the most timeless symbols of growth, harmony, prosperity, and natural balance. Designed with highly intricate handcrafted carving techniques, this elegant stone mural beautifully showcases a detailed tree composition surrounded by delicate branches, birds, foliage patterns, and artistic natural elements that create a visually striking architectural centerpiece.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1528\">Crafted using premium quality natural stone materials, this luxury mural combines artistic craftsmanship with long-lasting durability, making it an exceptional choice for interior spaces that demand sophistication and timeless design character. The deep sculpted relief work creates a beautiful three-dimensional effect that enhances lighting, texture, and architectural aesthetics while adding warmth and premium elegance to the surrounding environment.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1904\">Manufactured for long-term performance with minimal maintenance requirements, this premium handcrafted stone mural is perfectly suited for luxury homes, villa interiors, meditation spaces, hotel lobbies, premium office interiors, reception areas, restaurants, wellness centers, and bespoke architectural feature walls where design and craftsmanship define the overall space.<\/p